    "path": "chernobylite-trainer/README.md",
    "content": "# Chernobylite Trainer\n\nA memory-based trainer for Chernobylite (Windows version) using low-level Windows API calls. Features include:\n- Infinite Health\n- Infinite Stamina\n- Infinite Resources\n- Unlimited Ammo\n- No Radiation\n\n## Requirements\n- Windows 10/11\n- .NET 8.0 SDK\n- Chernobylite game (Steam/GOG)\n\n## Build\n```\ndotnet build\n```\n\n## Run\n```\ndotnet run --project src/ChernobyliteTrainer\n```\n\n## Test\n```\ndotnet test tests/ChernobyliteTrainer.Tests\n```\n\n**Note:** This is for educational purposes only. Use at your own risk."
  },
